  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The name first appears in the Gu Yue clan secret room on the Blood Moon Gu recipe plate that Fang Yuan memorizes.",
        "chapters": [
          157
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_yue_clan",
          "gu_blood_moon_gu",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Paired with Roaming Zombie Gu, Blood Essence Gu would greatly reduce that Gu’s side effects and let the user stay a zombie longer without backlash worries. Xiong Jiang once desired a Blood Essence Gu badly. He was already a well-to-do rank two Gu Master with a rather high position, but until he died he never obtained one.",
        "chapters": [
          157
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairing-with-roaming-zombie-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_roaming_zombie_gu",
          "char_xiong_jiang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "An earlier chapter says Roaming Zombie Gu is best used with Bloodline Gu, and that without that pairing long use drains the body’s blood and can turn the user into a true zombie.",
        "chapters": [
          126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairing-with-roaming-zombie-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bloodline Gu is named for that pairing at chapter 126, and Blood Essence Gu is named for the same pairing purpose at chapter 157. The text never states that those two names are one Gu.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pairing-with-roaming-zombie-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
